//! START core-spine Rust kernels.
//!
//! * Cedar (cedar-policy/cedar, Apache-2.0): evaluate the policies in
//!   `../policies.cedar` with the real Cedar engine.
//! * egg (egraphs-good/egg, MIT): e-graph rewrite demo — simplify
//!   `x + 0` to `x`, the kind of symbolic rewrite the reasoning
//!   module needs. This is a demo, not a planner.
//! * Tonic (grpc/grpc-rust, MIT): the gRPC service from
//!   `../proto/constraint_evaluation.proto`, code-generated by
//!   tonic-build and served for real by `server.rs` (binary
//!   `start-tonic-server`) over a Unix socket. See `server` module.
//! * ash-flare (ashforge-rs/ash-flare, Apache-2.0): local supervision
//!   of execution workers only (`supervision` module). Default
//!   features only, distributed mode OFF by non-use, `Transient`
//!   restart policy. Supervision is liveness, never verification.

